<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila firms in the market for 35,000 T U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Manila firms in the market for 35,000 T U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Traders said on Friday a second Philippine firm advised commodity houses that it was in the market for 23,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat, bringing the total local requirement to 35,000 tonnes.</p>
</text>
